WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.896
- Just labor is not going
to get you somewhere.

00:00:03.896 --> 00:00:07.973
The right kind of action, the
right timing, right place.

00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:10.608
All this is important, isn't it.

00:00:10.608 --> 00:00:13.991
The events around you may
not be determined by you,

00:00:13.991 --> 00:00:18.026
but how your experience
of life is on this planet

00:00:18.026 --> 00:00:20.499
is 100% determined by you.

00:00:20.499 --> 00:00:22.883
Believe me, you're not
going to be here forever.

00:00:22.883 --> 00:00:24.323
I will bless you with a long life,

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:26.089
but you're going to fall dead one day.

00:00:26.089 --> 00:00:28.353
If you're beginning to
think that what you're doing

00:00:28.353 --> 00:00:31.439
is very important, you
need to take a holiday.

00:00:31.439 --> 00:00:34.690
You cannot fight, or you cannot overcome

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.822
that which does not exist.

00:00:36.822 --> 00:00:40.080
We have fixed too many
things on the outside.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.732
If you fix anymore, there
won't be a planet left.

00:00:43.732 --> 00:00:47.104
- He's an Indian yogi mystic
philanthropist and author.

00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:48.831
He founded a nonprofit organization,

00:00:48.831 --> 00:00:51.627
which offers yoga
programs around the world.

00:00:51.627 --> 00:00:53.436
He also founded Project Green Hand,

00:00:53.436 --> 00:00:55.738
a grassroots ecological
initiative in India.

00:00:55.738 --> 00:00:57.841
He's Sadhguru, and here's my take

00:00:57.841 --> 00:01:00.022
on his Top 10 Rules for Success.

00:01:00.022 --> 00:01:02.074
My personal favorite clip is number seven,

00:01:02.074 --> 00:01:03.800
so I'm curious to figure out

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.550
which one you guys like the best.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:11.580
- Effort has to be incisive in a sense.

00:01:13.655 --> 00:01:16.260
It should be focused, calibrated.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:20.427
Simply if you make effort,
it's foolish effort, isn't it?

00:01:22.134 --> 00:01:24.978
Just labor is not going
to get you somewhere.

00:01:24.978 --> 00:01:29.145
The right kind of action, the
right timing, right place.

00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:33.234
All this is important, isn't it?

00:01:35.305 --> 00:01:38.138
So for all these things to happen,

00:01:39.936 --> 00:01:43.019
you need perception and intelligence.

00:01:44.216 --> 00:01:47.059
So that's all you must do in your life.

00:01:47.059 --> 00:01:51.126
Constantly looking for ways
to enhance your perception

00:01:51.126 --> 00:01:52.893
and your intelligence.

00:01:52.893 --> 00:01:55.226
The rest will anyway happen.

00:01:57.785 --> 00:02:00.088
This is one thing that, unfortunately,

00:02:00.088 --> 00:02:01.887
humanity is not doing.

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:05.719
They're trying to become
capable of something.

00:02:05.719 --> 00:02:09.050
They're not trying to
be capable of something.

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:11.608
Just enhance your
perception and intelligence.

00:02:11.608 --> 00:02:14.656
Can you see me right now, all of you?

00:02:14.656 --> 00:02:17.208
Can you see me?
Just point out where I am.

00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:20.946
Use your hands and point out.
Can you see me?

00:02:20.946 --> 00:02:24.529
Oh you got it wrong.
You know I am a mystic.

00:02:27.299 --> 00:02:29.847
You're getting it completely wrong.

00:02:29.847 --> 00:02:32.485
Now this light is falling upon me,

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:34.998
reflecting, going through your lenses,

00:02:34.998 --> 00:02:36.727
in order to imagine you're 80 now.

00:02:36.727 --> 00:02:38.952
You know the whole story, right?

00:02:38.952 --> 00:02:42.448
Where do you see me right now?
Within yourself.

00:02:42.448 --> 00:02:44.172
Where do you hear me right now?

00:02:44.172 --> 00:02:45.419
Within yourself.

00:02:45.419 --> 00:02:48.356
Where have you seen the whole world?

00:02:48.356 --> 00:02:49.602
Within yourself.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:53.764
Have you ever experienced
anything outside of yourself?

00:02:53.764 --> 00:02:56.809
Everything that ever happened to you.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.996
Darkness and light happened within you.

00:02:59.996 --> 00:03:02.407
Pain and pleasure happened within you.

00:03:02.407 --> 00:03:04.581
Joy and misery happened within you.

00:03:04.581 --> 00:03:08.649
Have you ever experienced
anything outside of yourself?

00:03:08.649 --> 00:03:12.816
No, so what I am asking you
is what happens within you?

00:03:15.171 --> 00:03:18.671
Who should determine how it should happen?

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.624
What happens within you?

00:03:23.624 --> 00:03:27.291
Who should determine
how this should happen?

00:03:28.518 --> 00:03:29.685
Somebody else?

00:03:30.558 --> 00:03:33.143
Definitely you should determine

00:03:33.143 --> 00:03:35.366
what should happen within this, isn't it?

00:03:35.366 --> 00:03:38.165
So if you determine what's
happening within this,

00:03:38.165 --> 00:03:42.338
your whole experience of life
will be determined by you.

00:03:42.338 --> 00:03:44.804
Nobody else but you, isn't it?

00:03:44.804 --> 00:03:48.736
The events around you may
not be determined by you,

00:03:48.736 --> 00:03:52.570
but how your experience
of life is on this planet

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:56.728
is 100% determined by you
if you take charge of this.

00:03:56.728 --> 00:04:00.895
If you leave it loose, just
about anybody will determine it.

00:04:02.652 --> 00:04:04.748
They will.
Not consciously.

00:04:04.748 --> 00:04:07.204
They also like you by accident.

00:04:07.204 --> 00:04:11.371
If you just observe, if
everybody makes a little effort,

00:04:13.882 --> 00:04:18.086
everybody take a little time
for this piece of life, okay?

00:04:18.086 --> 00:04:21.165
Not for your family.
Not for your career.

00:04:21.165 --> 00:04:23.107
Not for something else, something else.

00:04:23.107 --> 00:04:25.123
Just for this piece of life.

00:04:25.123 --> 00:04:28.051
Give it little time because
this is the most important piece

00:04:28.051 --> 00:04:30.692
of life in your life, isn't it?

00:04:30.692 --> 00:04:31.525
Yes or no?

00:04:31.525 --> 00:04:32.358
- Yes.

00:04:32.358 --> 00:04:34.153
- Even if you are in love with somebody.

00:04:34.153 --> 00:04:36.909
Still, this is their most
important piece of life, isn't it?

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:40.992
So pay some attention to this.
How does it happen?

00:04:40.992 --> 00:04:43.797
Why have you taken it for granted?

00:04:43.797 --> 00:04:46.620
Believe me, you're not
going to be here forever.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:47.978
I will bless you with a long life,

00:04:47.978 --> 00:04:50.818
but you are going to fall dead one day.

00:04:50.818 --> 00:04:52.152
Yes or no?
- Yes.

00:04:52.152 --> 00:04:54.992
- So do not take this for granted.

00:04:54.992 --> 00:04:57.446
If you wake up in the morning,

00:04:57.446 --> 00:05:01.613
tomorrow, if you wake up in
the morning (audience laughs).

00:05:02.795 --> 00:05:06.279
It is not my wish, but I want you to know,

00:05:06.279 --> 00:05:09.080
of all the people go
who go to bed tonight,

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:13.259
over a million people will
not wake up tomorrow morning.

00:05:13.259 --> 00:05:17.384
And tomorrow, if you and me
wake up tomorrow morning,

00:05:17.384 --> 00:05:19.732
is it not a fantastic thing?

00:05:19.732 --> 00:05:22.417
A million people did not wake up.

00:05:22.417 --> 00:05:25.568
You woke up.
Is that not a great thing?

00:05:25.568 --> 00:05:28.488
Just look at the ceiling and smile.

00:05:28.488 --> 00:05:31.738
You are still awake.
YOu're still there.

00:05:33.336 --> 00:05:36.395
And for many many millions of people,

00:05:36.395 --> 00:05:40.149
somebody who is dear to
them did not wake up.

00:05:40.149 --> 00:05:43.428
So just check those five
or six people around you.

00:05:43.428 --> 00:05:47.014
They all woke up.
Wow, it's a fantastic day.

00:05:47.014 --> 00:05:49.951
You woke up, and everybody who matters

00:05:49.951 --> 00:05:54.118
to you around you woke up.
is it not a fantastic day?

00:05:55.473 --> 00:05:57.556
You don't think so.
- Yes.

00:05:59.056 --> 00:06:02.933
- You don't seem to think
so because the problem

00:06:02.933 --> 00:06:03.993
is just this.

00:06:03.993 --> 00:06:08.075
You are living with an
idea that you are immortal.

00:06:08.075 --> 00:06:09.927
When I say you're immortal,

00:06:09.927 --> 00:06:12.441
you're not actually
thinking you're immortal,

00:06:12.441 --> 00:06:15.607
but you're not conscious
of your mortality.

00:06:15.607 --> 00:06:18.156
If you are not conscious
of your mortality,

00:06:18.156 --> 00:06:20.908
somewhere you think
you're immortal, isn't it?

00:06:20.908 --> 00:06:24.027
How many moments in a
day are you conscious

00:06:24.027 --> 00:06:25.608
that you're mortal?

00:06:25.608 --> 00:06:29.389
If you are conscious, would
you have time to crimp?

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:32.144
Would you have time to
fight with somebody?

00:06:32.144 --> 00:06:35.850
Would you have time to do
some rubbish with your life?

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:39.113
If you knew, if you are
conscious that you are mortal,

00:06:39.113 --> 00:06:41.472
you will do nothing other than

00:06:41.472 --> 00:06:45.132
what is absolutely needed for
you and everybody around you.

00:06:45.132 --> 00:06:48.392
This one thing if you do,
if you just remind yourself,

00:06:48.392 --> 00:06:50.277
don't think this a negative thing.

00:06:50.277 --> 00:06:52.049
Death is not a negative thing.

00:06:52.049 --> 00:06:54.680
It is the only thing which
has added value to your life.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.642
If you are here forever,
you would be unbearable.

00:06:57.642 --> 00:07:01.264
(audience laughs)

00:07:01.264 --> 00:07:05.264
We ought to be glad that
everybody does one day.

00:07:06.161 --> 00:07:09.858
If you just become
conscious of this thing.

00:07:09.858 --> 00:07:12.534
That always you are
conscious that I am mortal.

00:07:12.534 --> 00:07:14.180
You don't have to think I will die today.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:15.706
We don't intend.

00:07:15.706 --> 00:07:17.314
We want to live as far as possible.

00:07:17.314 --> 00:07:19.086
Just you know one day I will die.

00:07:19.086 --> 00:07:21.601
If you're just conscious
of this one thing,

00:07:21.601 --> 00:07:23.293
you will naturally become spiritual.

00:07:23.293 --> 00:07:25.636
Every day, every moment
if you remind yourself

00:07:25.636 --> 00:07:27.942
this is a brief life, I am
mortal, one day I will end.

00:07:27.942 --> 00:07:30.735
Just do this for two days and see.

00:07:30.735 --> 00:07:34.905
You will become something
truly fantastic within yourself

00:07:34.905 --> 00:07:36.322
just as a result.

00:07:36.322 --> 00:07:40.167
- That is simply beautiful.
- That is all that is needed.

00:07:40.167 --> 00:07:43.338
If you want to know the value of life,

00:07:43.338 --> 00:07:46.505
just know that it's a brief happening.

00:07:47.538 --> 00:07:50.836
Just loosen up your life a
little bit, laugh a little more,

00:07:50.836 --> 00:07:53.879
involve yourself with people around you.

00:07:53.879 --> 00:07:57.624
Do things that you think
is not so important.

00:07:57.624 --> 00:08:00.546
Don't do things which are very important.

00:08:00.546 --> 00:08:01.919
Do simple things.

00:08:01.919 --> 00:08:04.594
It's very important you do simple things.

00:08:04.594 --> 00:08:07.313
Very important things you
are doing in your life

00:08:07.313 --> 00:08:09.730
you will become very serious.

00:08:10.564 --> 00:08:13.981
You know Bertrand Russel, an English man.

00:08:16.539 --> 00:08:20.693
Bertrand Russell said if
you're beginning to think

00:08:20.693 --> 00:08:23.209
that what you're doing is very important,

00:08:23.209 --> 00:08:25.346
you need to take a holiday.

00:08:25.346 --> 00:08:27.936
So holiday does not mean coming to India.

00:08:27.936 --> 00:08:29.686
Holiday is every day.

00:08:31.238 --> 00:08:33.912
In those 24 hours, you must take a holiday

00:08:33.912 --> 00:08:36.996
from your seriousness, from yourself.

00:08:36.996 --> 00:08:39.304
Seriousness comes essentially

00:08:39.304 --> 00:08:41.942
because of your self importance.

00:08:41.942 --> 00:08:45.191
You hold yourself as an important person.

00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:47.796
I want you to see you
are like a speck of dust

00:08:47.796 --> 00:08:48.982
in this existence.

00:08:48.982 --> 00:08:51.659
Tomorrow morning if you disappear,

00:08:51.659 --> 00:08:54.541
for sure in India, nobody will miss you.

00:08:54.541 --> 00:08:58.951
Even Down Under, they won't
bother much, you know.

00:08:58.951 --> 00:09:03.193
A handful of people, they
will also forget soon enough.

00:09:03.193 --> 00:09:04.193
Isn't it so?

00:09:05.748 --> 00:09:08.748
Woof, nature does woof, you're gone.

00:09:10.476 --> 00:09:13.317
And nothing will happen in this world.

00:09:13.317 --> 00:09:15.371
Everything will happen wonderfully well

00:09:15.371 --> 00:09:17.143
even if you're not there.

00:09:17.143 --> 00:09:18.996
Every human being should be aware of this

00:09:18.996 --> 00:09:20.762
every moment of his life.

00:09:20.762 --> 00:09:24.597
It does not matter what the
whole world says about you.

00:09:24.597 --> 00:09:28.672
It does not matter how
significant a work you're doing.

00:09:28.672 --> 00:09:31.637
You must understand that tomorrow morning

00:09:31.637 --> 00:09:34.804
the world will go on fine without you,

00:09:36.241 --> 00:09:38.803
whoever you may be.
Isn't it so?

00:09:38.803 --> 00:09:42.271
If you constantly remind yourself of this,

00:09:42.271 --> 00:09:46.438
you will have no reason to
be serious (laughs softly).

00:09:50.575 --> 00:09:54.158
Definitely not dead,
and don't be dead now.

00:09:55.908 --> 00:09:59.325
The time will come.
It's time to be alive.

00:10:00.819 --> 00:10:04.986
To create fear, you have to
use excessive imagination.

00:10:06.632 --> 00:10:10.722
To not be in fear, you
don't have to do anything.

00:10:10.722 --> 00:10:14.852
Fear is happening because
of excessive imagination.

00:10:14.852 --> 00:10:19.072
Things that have not
happened, you are creating.

00:10:19.072 --> 00:10:21.405
What may happen in your mind

00:10:23.152 --> 00:10:26.319
happens in thousand different formats.

00:10:27.644 --> 00:10:30.293
And most probably never happens.

00:10:30.293 --> 00:10:33.939
The things that you
fear, the kind of things

00:10:33.939 --> 00:10:38.073
that you have feared, probably
99 of them never happened,

00:10:38.073 --> 00:10:39.156
isn't it?
Yes.

00:10:41.858 --> 00:10:45.820
So your fear is about
that which does not exist.

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:49.070
You cannot fight or you cannot overcome

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.337
that which does not exist.

00:10:54.281 --> 00:10:57.456
We can overcome something that exists.

00:10:57.456 --> 00:11:01.279
You cannot overcome that
which does not exist.

00:11:01.279 --> 00:11:04.807
You just have to just give up that effort.

00:11:04.807 --> 00:11:06.017
Enjoy the fear.

00:11:06.017 --> 00:11:07.610
After all, it's your making.

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:09.516
You like horror movies.

00:11:09.516 --> 00:11:13.183
You're saying no, but
you're producing them.

00:11:15.518 --> 00:11:18.852
It's just they're not making
money, that's all (laughs).

00:11:18.852 --> 00:11:21.685
(audience laughs)

00:11:23.218 --> 00:11:28.112
Fear means you are producing
horror movies in your mind.

00:11:28.112 --> 00:11:31.125
Nobody else is willing to watch.

00:11:31.125 --> 00:11:34.212
That's bad for the producer.

00:11:34.212 --> 00:11:36.379
But you're producing them.

00:11:38.373 --> 00:11:40.873
So you produce something else.

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:47.357
Produce a comedy, a love
story, suspense, thriller.

00:11:49.369 --> 00:11:50.952
Try and see, today.

00:11:51.799 --> 00:11:56.799
Just sit down and produce a
love story, a suspense thriller,

00:11:56.799 --> 00:12:00.963
a comedy, five-minute movies
you make in your mind.

00:12:00.963 --> 00:12:04.466
Really, start using your mind differently.

00:12:04.466 --> 00:12:06.970
It's gotten into your pattern.

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:10.436
Just gotten into pattern of
just creating horror movies

00:12:10.436 --> 00:12:11.505
all the time.

00:12:11.505 --> 00:12:15.461
You have watched enough
horror movies, they're boring.

00:12:15.461 --> 00:12:17.294
Create something else.

00:12:18.428 --> 00:12:20.702
It's not that if you produce these movies,

00:12:20.702 --> 00:12:22.759
these things will happen in your life.

00:12:22.759 --> 00:12:23.875
Still they may not happen.

00:12:23.875 --> 00:12:26.301
At least you enjoyed the movie.

00:12:26.301 --> 00:12:29.468
In reality, it may not happen.
So what.

00:12:31.748 --> 00:12:34.678
At least you enjoy what's
happening in your mind

00:12:34.678 --> 00:12:38.427
if you cannot enjoy what's
happening in the world, isn't it?

00:12:38.427 --> 00:12:42.335
That much privilege every human
being deserves, isn't it so?

00:12:42.335 --> 00:12:44.877
Even though the world is not kind to him,

00:12:44.877 --> 00:12:47.638
at least his own mind
should be kind to him.

00:12:47.638 --> 00:12:50.196
Should produce some nice noise.

00:12:50.196 --> 00:12:54.138
We are completely committed to
one dimensional intelligence,

00:12:54.138 --> 00:12:56.260
which we call the intellect.

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:59.033
Which is just the thought process.

00:12:59.033 --> 00:13:01.177
Thought can only happen with the data

00:13:01.177 --> 00:13:03.457
that you have gathered
through five senses.

00:13:03.457 --> 00:13:05.886
Which is very limited, one thing.

00:13:05.886 --> 00:13:09.454
And another thing is the nature of data

00:13:09.454 --> 00:13:13.616
that the senses gather are only
useful for survival process.

00:13:13.616 --> 00:13:16.742
The very nature of how you see things,

00:13:16.742 --> 00:13:20.300
how you hear, smell, and
taste, and touch life

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:23.460
is only relevant for survival process.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:26.905
If you're wanting to know the life itself,

00:13:26.905 --> 00:13:30.745
then these instruments of
perception are no good.

00:13:30.745 --> 00:13:34.034
Even what is light and
darkness is a debate

00:13:34.034 --> 00:13:36.516
between you and another creature,

00:13:36.516 --> 00:13:39.756
which sees darkness as light, isn't it?

00:13:39.756 --> 00:13:43.040
If you sit with an owl
and start an argument

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:46.745
as to which is light
and which is darkness,

00:13:46.745 --> 00:13:50.912
it's an endless argument, but
who do you think is right?

00:13:53.992 --> 00:13:58.146
If you think both, you're
either in the diplomatic corps

00:13:58.146 --> 00:14:02.313
or you have a successful
marriage (audience applauds).

00:14:05.446 --> 00:14:06.923
- [Host] Some have both.

00:14:06.923 --> 00:14:10.812
- You learn to say both
but which is the truth?

00:14:10.812 --> 00:14:13.994
What I see as the truth and
what the owl sees as the truth,

00:14:13.994 --> 00:14:15.513
that's not the point.

00:14:15.513 --> 00:14:19.051
It is just that nature has
opened up our sense perception

00:14:19.051 --> 00:14:21.965
as it is necessary for our survival.

00:14:21.965 --> 00:14:24.895
Accordingly, it has opened
up sense perceptions

00:14:24.895 --> 00:14:28.596
for different creates as it is
necessary for their survival.

00:14:28.596 --> 00:14:31.517
But if survival is all you're seeking,

00:14:31.517 --> 00:14:34.277
this is good enough, the five senses.

00:14:34.277 --> 00:14:37.119
But once you have come as a human being,

00:14:37.119 --> 00:14:40.165
somehow survival is not good enough.

00:14:40.165 --> 00:14:43.373
If your stomach is empty,
there's only one issue,

00:14:43.373 --> 00:14:47.084
about food, but once the
stomach becomes full,

